    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">即使你知曉其他語言，倘若沒有魔法的協助，你也無法說出斯里克林語以外的語言。你使用心靈感應作爲替代來傳達你的想法。你擁有一種能將你的想法通過心靈傳遞給你120尺內且你可見的自願生物的魔法能力。一個被你連接的生物無需與你擁有共通語言就可以理解你的思想，但是需要至少能夠理解一種語言。你與一個生物的心靈感應連接會在以下情況下斷裂：你和該生物之間的距離超過 120 尺，你們兩者之一失能，或你們兩者之一心靈上斷開連接（無需動作）。</span></p></div></div></div><p>Without the assistance of magic, you can't speak the non-thri-kreen languages you know. Instead you use telepathy to convey your thoughts. You have the magical ability to transmit your thoughts mentally to willing creatures within 120 feet of yourself. A contacted creature doesn't need to share a language with you to understand your thoughts, but it must be able to understand at least one language. Your telepathic link to a creature is broken if you and the creature move more than 120 feet apart, if either of you is &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated], or if either of you mentally breaks the contact (no action required).</p></div>",
